Not linked into ~/.claude/skills/ by default, and /sync-config leaves it alone.

This skill does a job that happens once per machine — migrating ~/.aws/config to sso-session
blocks. Carrying it in the always-loaded skill list costs trigger surface for the rest of time
with no benefit. It is reached by argument instead:

  /dev-tools aws-sso

dev-tools/ holds a symlink to this directory, which replaces the older dance of linking it for
the migration and removing it afterwards — there is nothing to install and nothing to undo. Read
dev-tools/SKILL.md for the dispatch table.

Any skill directory carrying this marker is treated the same way.
